                                                    Knowledge-Management:Reference .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/thoma/ontologies/2026/02/Knowledge-Management#ContentType-Troubleshooting
Knowledge-Management:ContentType-Troubleshooting rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                          Knowledge-Management:Troubleshooting .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/thoma/ontologies/2026/02/Knowledge-Management#Deprecated
Knowledge-Management:Deprecated rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                         Knowledge-Management:LifecycleStage ;
                                Knowledge-Management:transitionsTo Knowledge-Management:Archived ;
                                rdfs:comment "The lifecycle stage in which a knowledge asset has been superseded or is no longer recommended for use, but remains accessible pending full retirement. Trigger: EditorialDecision." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/thoma/ontologies/2026/02/Knowledge-Management#Draft
Knowledge-Management:Draft rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                    Knowledge-Management:LifecycleStage ;
                           Knowledge-Management:transitionsTo Knowledge-Management:InReview ;
                           rdfs:comment "The initial lifecycle stage in which a knowledge asset is being actively created or revised. Content is incomplete, unvalidated, and not yet available for general practitioner use." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/thoma/ontologies/2026/02/Knowledge-Management#Expired
Knowledge-Management:Expired rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      Knowledge-Management:LifecycleStage ;
                             Knowledge-Management:transitionsTo Knowledge-Management:Archived ;
                             rdfs:comment "The lifecycle stage in which a knowledge asset has passed its defined validity period and is no longer considered current or authoritative. Trigger: TemporalCondition." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/thoma/ontologies/2026/02/Knowledge-Management#InReview
Knowledge-Management:InReview rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                       Knowledge-Management:LifecycleStage ;
                              Knowledge-Management:transitionsTo Knowledge-Management:Approved ,
                                                                 Knowledge-Management:Draft ;
                              rdfs:comment "The lifecycle stage in which a knowledge asset has been submitted for evaluation against quality, accuracy, or compliance standards." .

[ rdf:type owl:Axiom ;
   owl:annotatedSource Knowledge-Management:InReview ;
   owl:annotatedProperty Knowledge-Management:transitionsTo ;
   owl:annotatedTarget Knowledge-Management:Draft ;
   rdfs:comment "Lifecycle stage reverts to Draft if content is not Approved during the InReview stage."
 ] .


